# The marked Draisma--Vargas counts

The Draisma--Vargas count of tropical morphisms to trees, with ramification prescribed at marked
points of the source.

* `DraismaVargas.Count.MarkedCount.markedCount_eq_catalan` (`MarkedCount/`): the count with
  ramification one at every marked point. Over a general marked cubic core of genus `g` with `k`
  marks and `g + k = 2K + 2`, `K ≥ 2`, the marked members of degree `K + 2` ramified at every
  mark number the Catalan number `C_{K+1}`; the once- and twice-marked forms are beside it.
* `DraismaVargas.Count.MarkedCountGeneral.typedCount_twiceMarked` (`MarkedCountGeneral/`): the
  count with ramification prescribed at two marked points, for every pair of ramification orders
  `(a, b)`. In degree `d = (g + a + b + 2)/2 ≤ g`, with `L = g + 1 − d`, it is
  `C(g, L + a) − C(g, L − 1)`, for `g ≥ 5`, or `g = 4` with `a` and `b` odd; the once-marked
  form is `DraismaVargas.Count.MarkedCountGeneral.typedCount_onceMarked`.

Add an import line above whenever a module is added under `DraismaVargasMarkedCount/`, or
`lake build DraismaVargasMarkedCount` will silently skip it.
-/
